            "card_desc": "I recently had the chance to try out the men’s heated vest from Venustas, and I was genuinely impressed. The quality is excellent, and it has a clean, stylish look. It fits true to size and is lightweight enough to pack easily for trips or outdoor activities. Even without turning on the heating elements, the vest is surprisingly warm — and with the heater on, it’s even better. Overall, a great piece to have for cooler weather.",
