          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "card_title": "Gear Junkie",
            "card_desc": "If you are always cold or sometimes let frigid temps keep you from heading outside, the Venustas Classic Heated Vest is well worth investing in. It could be used for hiking, walking your dog, worn in hunting blinds, or simply in offices that are too cold.",
